},
{
"text": "[image: When it comes to housing policy in Newtown CT, mobile homes matter]",
"href": "https://kuisforyou.com/mobile-home-communities-matter/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Your property-tax bill deserves more than vague promises. Michelle wrote a new white paper that explains the real forces pushing costs onto Newtown taxpayers—and the state-level changes that can provide meaningful relief. It’s short, fact-based, and worth a few minutes of your time. Read the full white paper at kuisforyou.com or click this link [https://kuisforyou.com/why-your-property-tax-bill-goes-up-and-what-can-be-done-about-it/] #NewtownCT #PropertyTaxes #TaxRelief #Connecticut #Hartford #LocalTaxes #NewtownPolitics]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdkSHJGCj1v/"
},
